<title>SINGAPORE: Orchard Parade, YHS win S$189 mln tender.</title>
<headline>Orchard Parade, YHS win S$189 mln tender.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orchard Parade Holdings Ltd said on Friday the Housing &amp; Development Board (HDB) had accepted a tender of Singapore $189.1 million submitted by one of its units and Yeo Hiap Seng Ltd for a land parcel in Singapore.  </p>
<p>Orchard Parade said in a statement the tender had been been submitted jointly by its wholly-owned unit, Orchard Parade Land, and YHS on an 80:20 basis.</p>
<p>The land lease, with a total site area of 22,848.4 sq metres, was valid for 99 years, it said.</p>
<p>The acquisition was not expected to have any material effect on the net tangible assets and earnings per share of the company for the year ending December 31, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
